{"seq":1,"slug":"falco-runtime-detection","title":"Falco 运行时威胁检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/runtime/falco-runtime-detection","wordCount":957,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"falco-运行时威胁检测\">Falco 运行时威胁检测</h1><p>静态扫描在镜像推送前完成，准入控制在 Pod 创建时执行——但当容器已经在生产环境中运行数小时后，一个零日漏洞被利用了，攻击者在容器内获得了 shell，静态手段对此束手无策。Falco（CNCF 毕业项目，Sysdig 创建）通过实时监控容器的系统调用行为来填补这个空白：它不关心漏洞是否已知，只关心容器的行为是否偏离了预期模式——&quot;容器里不该出现交互式 shell&quot;、&quot;这个应用不该读取 <code>/etc/shadow</code>&quot;、&quot;生产容器不该发起到外部 IP 的出站连接&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Falco 的检测架构基于事件驱动的规则引擎：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Linux 内核] --&gt;|系统调用| B[eBPF 探针]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Falco 事件流]&#10;    C --&gt; D[规则引擎匹配]&#10;    D --&gt; E{触发规则?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[告警输出]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[丢弃事件]&#10;    F --&gt; H[Prometheus/Alertmanager]&#10;    F --&gt; I[SIEM/日志系统]&#10;    F --&gt; J[Kubernetes 响应]\">graph LR\n    A[Linux 内核] --&gt;|系统调用| B[eBPF 探针]\n    B --&gt; C[Falco 事件流]\n    C --&gt; D[规则引擎匹配]\n    D --&gt; E{触发规则?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[告警输出]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[丢弃事件]\n    F --&gt; H[Prometheus/Alertmanager]\n    F --&gt; I[SIEM/日志系统]\n    F --&gt; J[Kubernetes 响应]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Falco</th>\n<th>Tetragon（Cilium）</th>\n<th>对比要点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据源</td>\n<td>eBPF / 内核模块</td>\n<td>eBPF</td>\n<td>都基于内核级可见性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检测能力</td>\n<td>规则匹配告警</td>\n<td>规则匹配 + 实时阻断</td>\n<td>Tetragon 可 enforce</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规则语言</td>\n<td>Falco YAML DSL</td>\n<td>JSON TracingPolicy</td>\n<td>Falco 更易读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社区规则库</td>\n<td>丰富（300+ 默认规则）</td>\n<td>较少，需自建</td>\n<td>Falco 开箱即用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能开销</td>\n<td>1-3% CPU</td>\n<td>1-2% CPU</td>\n<td>均可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CNCF 状态</td>\n<td>Graduated</td>\n<td>Incubating</td>\n<td>Falco 更成熟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应能力</td>\n<td>检测 + 告警</td>\n<td>检测 + 告警 + Kill</td>\n<td>Tetragon 更强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"falco-规则体系\">Falco 规则体系</h2><p>Falco 规则由三个元素组成：<strong>condition</strong>（触发条件）、<strong>output</strong>（告警内容）、<strong>priority</strong>（严重级别）。条件基于系统调用事件的字段进行匹配：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 检测容器内执行 shell&#10;- rule: Shell spawned in container&#10;  desc: 在容器内产生了交互式 shell 进程&#10;  condition: &gt;&#10;    spawned_process and container and&#10;    proc.name in (bash, sh, zsh, dash, ksh) and&#10;    not proc.pname in (crond, containerd-shim)&#10;  output: &gt;&#10;    Shell spawned in container&#10;    (user=%user.name container=%container.name&#10;     image=%container.image.repository&#10;     shell=%proc.name parent=%proc.pname&#10;     cmdline=%proc.cmdline)&#10;  priority: WARNING&#10;  tags: [container, shell, mitre_execution]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检测容器内执行 shell</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Shell spawned in container</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  desc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">在容器内产生了交互式 shell 进程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    spawned_process and container and</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    proc.name in (bash, sh, zsh, dash, ksh) and</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    not proc.pname in (crond, containerd-shim)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Shell spawned in container</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (user=%user.name container=%container.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">     image=%container.image.repository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">     shell=%proc.name parent=%proc.pname</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">     cmdline=%proc.cmdline)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">WARNING</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">shell</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mitre_execution</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 检测读取敏感文件&#10;- rule: Read sensitive file in container&#10;  desc: 容器内进程读取了密码或密钥文件&#10;  condition: &gt;&#10;    open_read and container and&#10;    fd.name in (/etc/shadow, /etc/passwd, /root/.ssh/id_rsa) and&#10;    not proc.name in (sshd, su, sudo)&#10;  output: &gt;&#10;    Sensitive file read (user=%user.name file=%fd.name&#10;     container=%container.name image=%container.image.repository)&#10;  priority: CRITICAL&#10;  tags: [container, filesystem, mitre_credential_access]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 检测读取敏感文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">rule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Read sensitive file in container</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  desc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">容器内进程读取了密码或密钥文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    open_read and container and</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    fd.name in (/etc/shadow, /etc/passwd, /root/.ssh/id_rsa) and</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    not proc.name in (sshd, su, sudo)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  output</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    Sensitive file read (user=%user.name file=%fd.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">     container=%container.name image=%container.image.repository)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  priority</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">CRITICAL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">container</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">filesystem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">mitre_credential_access</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"部署架构与集成\">部署架构与集成</h2><p>Falco 在 Kubernetes 集群中以 DaemonSet 方式部署，确保每个节点上都有一个 Falco 实例监控该节点上所有容器的系统调用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# Helm 部署 Falco（推荐方式）&#10;# helm install falco falcosecurity/falco \\&#10;#   --namespace falco --create-namespace \\&#10;#   --set driver.kind=ebpf \\&#10;#   --set falcosidekick.enabled=true \\&#10;#   --set falcosidekick.config.slack.webhookurl=&quot;...&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Helm 部署 Falco（推荐方式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># helm install falco falcosecurity/falco \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   --namespace falco --create-namespace \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   --set driver.kind=ebpf \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   --set falcosidekick.enabled=true \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#   --set falcosidekick.config.slack.webhookurl=\"...\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>Falcosidekick</strong> 是告警路由组件，将 Falco 事件转发到 30+ 目标：Slack、PagerDuty、Prometheus/Alertmanager、Elasticsearch、AWS SecurityHub 等。它还支持触发 Kubernetes 响应动作（如 <code>kubectl delete pod</code>）来自动隔离被攻击的容器。</p>\n<p>生产环境推荐架构：Falco DaemonSet → Falcosidekick → 分流到 Alertmanager（实时告警）+ Elasticsearch/Loki（审计存储）+ Prometheus（度量指标）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"高价值检测规则\">高价值检测规则</h2><p>基于 MITRE ATT&amp;CK for Containers 的关键检测场景：</p>\n<p><strong>初始访问/执行</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>容器内产生 shell 进程（bash/sh）</li>\n<li>通过 kubectl exec 进入容器</li>\n<li>容器内运行非预期的二进制文件</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>凭据访问</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>读取 ServiceAccount Token（<code>/var/run/secrets/kubernetes.io/</code>）</li>\n<li>读取 <code>/etc/shadow</code> 或 SSH 密钥文件</li>\n<li>访问云元数据 API（<code>169.254.169.254</code>）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>持久化/横向移动</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>容器内发起到 Kubernetes API 的请求</li>\n<li>建立到非预期外部 IP 的网络连接</li>\n<li>修改容器根文件系统中的二进制文件</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>防御绕过</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>清除或修改日志文件</li>\n<li>修改 <code>/etc/resolv.conf</code>（DNS 劫持）</li>\n<li>在容器内加载内核模块</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"调优与误报管理\">调优与误报管理</h2><p>开箱即用的 Falco 规则集在实际环境中会产生大量误报。有效的调优策略：</p>\n<p><strong>白名单排除</strong>：为已知合法行为添加排除条件。例如，监控系统（Prometheus node-exporter）合法地读取 <code>/proc</code> 下的文件，需要在规则中排除。</p>\n<p><strong>基于镜像的策略</strong>：为不同镜像设定不同的行为基线。一个 nginx 容器永远不该执行 shell，但一个开发环境容器可能合法地执行 shell 操作。</p>\n<p><strong>渐进式部署</strong>：先以 <code>INFO</code> 级别收集数据一周，分析正常行为模式，然后逐步收紧规则并提升 priority，最终对关键规则启用自动响应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Falco 通过 eBPF 实时监控系统调用，检测容器运行时的异常行为模式</li>\n<li>规则基于 condition-output-priority 模型，覆盖 MITRE ATT&amp;CK 各阶段</li>\n<li>以 DaemonSet 部署，配合 Falcosidekick 实现多渠道告警路由</li>\n<li>Tetragon 在需要实时阻断（而非仅告警）时是补充选择</li>\n<li>调优是持续过程：先观察基线，再收紧规则，最后启用自动响应</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"seccomp-apparmor\">Seccomp 与 AppArmor 强制约束</a>——从&quot;检测告警&quot;升级到&quot;内核级阻断&quot;</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/architecture-and-concepts\">Kubernetes 架构与概念</a>——理解 Falco 监控的 Kubernetes 系统架构</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Falco 运行时威胁检测","id":"falco-运行时威胁检测"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Falco 规则体系","id":"falco-规则体系"},{"level":2,"text":"部署架构与集成","id":"部署架构与集成"},{"level":2,"text":"高价值检测规则","id":"高价值检测规则"},{"level":2,"text":"调优与误报管理","id":"调优与误报管理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"镜像签名与构建溯源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/supply-chain/signing-and-provenance"},"next":{"title":"Seccomp 与 AppArmor 强制约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/runtime/seccomp-apparmor"}}